    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8529b5c8986708befbd455",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "恐怕是的。它时不时就会在意肚子附近……你看，又来了。\n……它的眼神和叫声中，似乎也夹杂着痛苦与不适。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3733c97cf9f68b643c992cd23640c9966d84e9896fe9aa44d83ece418395d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf2d2ded4115a4ad2760a16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要不要我去买点什么？比如猫粮之类的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee6c9a82c63dfb58c8cfe5f340e78301f4cff08a1ee1c23d1cb66ad053662627",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42140caa1a548939ca56939e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金发赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "75941cf15f86c852b9b7bd466056dd01fa84167a182f1acb9e0014fee4c041e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9476412d2094ff6122ffcf9e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果可以的话，我想带它去医院。但只要一靠近，\n它就会不断往深处躲。我希望能想点办法帮帮它……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda0120ff3b3659514e822031be73b2cad1a95a829782f84797837dc4c5c7f72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2872864e2139b08df9a100d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此……要是它能对你敞开心扉就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb5de4640298fb4f90af1bbb7672b158a8277a2ade8980bfb4bfd3a4ffe2ff7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ed9e216ee8b0d7d4893e8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金发赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "75941cf15f86c852b9b7bd466056dd01fa84167a182f1acb9e0014fee4c041e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:119d0e8a8e2ba1a403742c4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢您。其实我也带了。\n但是，如果不让它放下戒备，它是不肯吃的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "55add17a380f097ca339b62c440b7382eb29703f70f727a2a6c9d59c311806ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb00c44e3b149b5f990d04c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金发赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "75941cf15f86c852b9b7bd466056dd01fa84167a182f1acb9e0014fee4c041e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c0e0b1d764a6aeaf94aa9bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯。谢谢您的关心。\n我打算一直在这里陪它，直到它愿意出来为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9066f98f501215ea530f0131d9a9df833e3fa4eab82f621d242b2bc5bccbe833",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e677cdc37a5f3aababdf3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后我和她道别，处理完自己的事情后——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac78361f8389ece89176bc94cfbe10d5b8bec376f45c2688951138e3aaa0a374",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780fda89d7e7612119bcd3e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仿佛清晨的晴天是个谎言一般，\n低垂的阴云中开始落下雨滴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7cddc897bb22bf424492a782fd6cb3da0bafbfb23129cb6acfc7f4ce06f22ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44830e6d4b81cebdbb67b7f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——到了傍晚，在从外面回来的路上。\n在大雨中，今早遇到的那位赛马娘和猫咪的事再次从脑海中掠过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcee9416601eb8033c486e777d9b5272f6d9cf739b3000912408b6cd87a6facf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780a601e0271c07d7868f879",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不会吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "f18d5783bc754213248d403d99332d3ecffa825a51bb30579215e6cbb4dc652a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa03da31fe02ba3accc9a137",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……应该不会吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "373a319d6f95b4d1248253d9d99a0002f882859fde76c83255bec84564213980",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1dc40eae517b8d0725acec2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金发赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "75941cf15f86c852b9b7bd466056dd01fa84167a182f1acb9e0014fee4c041e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
