    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95af1c3003fe60fcebce4dfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『我打算一直在这里陪它，直到它愿意出来为止』",
      "source_fingerprint": "6325c45500f59e572a1ce93f1b6aaa753b28410c727db9b084a5e2980ef25574",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5e406ad869243cfcd11619",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "清晨散步时造访的公园里。\n那位赛马娘正蹲在灌木丛前，对着什么说着话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "209cd757da817ba157d735679d44bd975dfbeb627b95a6aadfd33de0daf5bb94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe5a4a8c3f088af222fd7f52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在已经完全暗下来的高地上，只能听见淅淅沥沥的雨声。\n我想她应该已经回去了吧，然而——",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ffff370f3bae6ff76a23eee6ac5c28893332930a2d16667f73e517a1b61b4bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:638b14134535acc09485e384",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金发赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "75941cf15f86c852b9b7bd466056dd01fa84167a182f1acb9e0014fee4c041e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b2f744c396970cb22cb3f90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有点变冷了呢……要是感冒了可就糟糕了。\n我带了毛巾，可以把它当被子裹在身上哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4afb75da7c286b343282efa621192437926fe7984532fa1a3fda5be2857d2d3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c217a9cc9e5b22a39a3f8ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金发赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "75941cf15f86c852b9b7bd466056dd01fa84167a182f1acb9e0014fee4c041e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fb86f9bd323a7be15d41946",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，如果可以的话……要不要去医院看一看呢？\n不用害怕的。我会一直陪在你的身边哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6474a4ad090ca82dc716eaa0c6d29065d64ec1a2d147d014d59d72ed937b88b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca7cc252859c01069cae5d22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你……！连伞都不打……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c7dc53e31f413853edcd47e03b3b4583efbd692b0c650e5bd9c1f77fd9fb297",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eb9eb203ada1496e28e9c81",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你……！连伞都不撑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32410d4df341142f139471012aade57361cd2b27f2b2c882ba64147a7aacf74b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e91975ba7503d560e3fc7e97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——她还在。\n在雨中。在和今早同样的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3968927c5a30c61988d06b4f1b2e636714c5bcace1d592c2635f3b15d6a8982c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1143/storytimeline_041143001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9088871970c709eb65732de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你一直都在这里吗？",
