      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……猫咪一定需要治疗。所以——『不需要感到不安哦』\n直到把这份心意传达给它之前，再等一小会儿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a526b536a30a2a0feb8bdff802c454998bcc71386f76c4d2833a37ed63b6417b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
