      "uid": "zhcn:2ae68b4f2d8df0f02826de06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "猫咪终于靠近了她伸出的手，起初还小心翼翼——\n随后便开始用额头蹭了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1db7d0e120c40911fd04c8e23b1c9a1ef0b71dae0efbd6782a015a4cf0af7826",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
