      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……哼哼。你愿意相信我了呢。\n不用担心。一定会好起来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f16a2ffccd40da190552431a712ad6d4fe44137d462cc10bcd37da385ef476",
